# ============================================================
# Codex / Antigravity
# ============================================================

# IMPORTANT:
# Project-level AI instructions, rules, workflows, and skills
# should normally be committed to Git.
#
# Examples intentionally NOT ignored:
#
# AGENTS.md
# .agents/rules/
# .agents/workflows/
# .agents/skills/
#
# Do NOT ignore the entire .agents/ directory unless it contains
# only machine-local/generated data.
#
# Likewise, do not automatically ignore project-level Codex
# configuration or skills that are intended to travel with
# the repository.


